      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792149944212,
      "created": 1792133031794,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to Insert the node?\n\nTake the node -> node[bfs_len - 1 / 2]\n\ncheck: \n\nif node.left == NULL -> node.left = new_node -> return\n\nelse if node.right == NULL -> node.right = new_node -> return\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to Insert the node?\n\nTake the node -> node[bfs_len - 1 / 2]\n\ncheck: \n\nif node.left == NULL -> node.left = new_node -> return\n\nelse if node.right == NULL -> node.right = new_node -> return\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
