      "text": "if PN == 0\nif N < PN:\nif PN idx % 2 != 0 : PNPN left = N and N left = PN\nelse if PN idx % 2 == 0: PNPN right = N and N left = PN",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "if PN == 0\nif N < PN:\nif PN idx % 2 != 0 : PNPN left = N and N left = PN\nelse if PN idx % 2 == 0: PNPN right = N and N left = PN",
